# urllib3 CVEs fixed in 2.8.0, which IS what the image installs. The scanner
# reports "Installed Version 2.7.0" against
# /usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/urllib3-2.8.0.dist-info/METADATA --
# the path says 2.8.0 while the table says 2.7.0, i.e. a stale/duplicated
# dist-info entry in the python:3.11-alpine base layer. Reproduces on
# untouched main (v0.5.3), so it is not caused by any recent change.
# pip's own output in the same build confirms urllib3-2.8.0.
# https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97687
# https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-97689
# Re-evaluate on the next base image bump / Trivy DB update.
# Target removal: 2026-12-31.
CVE-2026-97687
CVE-2026-97689
